<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43813" root="&#xA;                        نبه&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا نَبِهَ لَهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He did not know it;</i> or <i>know,</i> or
<i>have knowledge, of it; was not cognizant of it;</i>
or <i>did not understand it.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبِهَ لِلأَمْرِ</span>
                        <i>His
attention became roused to the thing,</i> or <i>affair,
after he had forgotten it.</i> (AZ, S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا نَبِهْتُ لَهُ</span>:
see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا أَبِهْتُ لَهُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَهَ عَلَيْهِمْ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَأَ عَلَيهم</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبُهَ</span>
                        <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, eminent, celebrated, or
well known.</i> (S, K, * TA.)

